      "value": "Requirements extracted from Zimmermann Functional Requirements excel, downloaded July 3rd, 2026 after all requirements were confirmed. — source of truth. Req ID prefix: **HPC**.\n\n⚠️ **Rows with strikethrough are out of scope** — struck through in the Excel source file.\n\n|  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| **Req ID** | **Functional Area** | **Sub-Functional Area** | **Requirement** | **Status** | **Comments** | **User Stories** |\n| HPC-001 | Homepage & Content | Content Model & CMS Authoring | The system should serve all homepage content from Contentful as the sole CMS across all regional storefronts. | Confirmed | Open Discussion: Product Names/Prices - SFCC vs Contentful - Review with @Tim Lavelle  @Jasmijn Tsang | [https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=(text%20~%20%22HPC-001\\*%22%20or%20summary%20~%20%22HPC-001\\*%22%20or%20key%20%3D%20HPC-001)%20and%20project%20in%20(SFCC)%20ORDER%20BY%20created%20DESC](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=(text%20~%20%22HPC-001*%22%20or%20summary%20~%20%22HPC-001*%22%20or%20key%20%3D%20HPC-001)%20and%20project%20in%20(SFCC)%20ORDER%20BY%20created%20DESC) |\n| HPC-002 | Homepage & Content | Content Model & CMS Authoring | The system should provide a Contentful preview environment for authors to validate content before publishing to production. | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%3D%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-002> |\n| HPC-003 | Homepage & Content | Content Model & CMS Authoring | The system should manage all images and video assets through the CMS media library. | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%3D%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-003> |\n| HPC-004 | Homepage & Content | Content Model & CMS Authoring | The system should support videos referenced via embed URL within CMS content entries. | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issue