r edibility per storefront | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%3D%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-030> |\n| HPC-031 | Homepage & Content | Navigation — Footer | The system should display footer navigation links. | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%3D%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-031> |\n| HPC-032 | Homepage & Content | Navigation — Footer | The system should navigate the customer to the relevant page or destination when a footer link is clicked. | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%3D%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-032> |\n| HPC-033 | Homepage & Content | Navigation — Footer | The system should display copyright and legal text in the footer. | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%3D%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-033> |\n| HPC-034 | Homepage & Content | Navigation — Footer | The system should display a \"Join Us\" email capture field in the footer. | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%3D%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-034> |\n| HPC-035 | Homepage & Content | Navigation — Footer | The system should display a modal on clicking the Continue CTA to collect the customer's first name and last name. | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%3D%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-035> |\n| HPC-036 | Homepage & Content | Navigation — Footer | The system should pass email sign-up data to Omneo (who will then pass to Emarsys) | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%3D%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DPRD-036> |\n| HPC-037 | Homepage & Content | Navigation — Footer | The system should display appropriate privacy consent copy and a link to the local Privacy Policy on the sign-up modal. | Confirmed | Additional Note: Should display Accessibility  @Jasmijn Tsang | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql